9. TOKEN BUDGET
====================================================================

Implement a configurable ContextBudget.

Support:

Maximum total tokens

Maximum tokens per section

Reserved tokens

Minimum tokens

Warning threshold

Overflow behavior

IMPORTANT:

If the project does not already have a tokenizer dependency, DO NOT add a heavyweight tokenizer just for this sprint.

Create a deterministic token-estimation abstraction/interface.

Use a documented approximation implementation if necessary.

The estimator must be replaceable later with a model-specific tokenizer.

====================================================================
10. BUDGET STRATEGY
====================================================================

When context exceeds the budget:

1. Preserve CRITICAL
2. Preserve HIGH where possible
3. Preserve NORMAL according to priority
4. Trim LOW
5. Remove OPTIONAL first

Never silently remove CRITICAL context.

If CRITICAL context alone exceeds the maximum budget:

Return a structured overflow warning/error according to the architecture.

Do not silently truncate critical information.

